 "description": "Search OTX threat-intel pulses by KEYWORD \u2014 campaign, malware family or actor name, e.g. \"ransomware\" or \"APT29\". Returns pulse ID, name, description preview, tags, targeted countries, malware families, attack IDs, and indicator count. This matches pulse titles and descriptions, so a bare indicator value (an IP, domain, hash or CVE id) will find nothing here \u2014 use lookup_indicator for those.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "examples": [
